flowchart TD
    Start([Agent Receives Input]) --> WrapModelStart

    WrapModelStart --> CallModel[Call LLM Model]
    CallModel --> WrapModelEnd

    WrapModelEnd -.->|Task Complete| FinalResult[Return Final Result]
    FinalResult --> End([End])

    WrapModelEnd -.->|Use Tool| WrapToolStart

    WrapToolStart --> ExecuteTool[Execute Selected Tool]
    ExecuteTool --> WrapToolEnd
    WrapToolEnd --> WrapModelStart

    WrapModelStart["@wrap_model_call (Enter)<br/>- Validate balance > 0<br/>- Record input prompt in AgentModelUsage"]:::middleware
    WrapModelEnd["@wrap_model_call (Exit)<br/>- Record model output in AgentModelUsage<br/>- Deduct cost via Transaction"]:::middleware
    WrapToolStart["@wrap_tool_call (Enter)<br/>- Record tool input in AgentToolUsage"]:::middleware
    WrapToolEnd["@wrap_tool_call (Exit)<br/>- Record tool output in AgentToolUsage"]:::middleware

    classDef middleware stroke-dasharray: 5 5
